# Omarchy 4.5.0-3 path set (spec ReproOS-Add-On-Mode §4.3.2): every /etc path the omarchy package's files under usr/share/omarchy/install/ and usr/share/omarchy/migrations/ name. Derived without the add-on, from omarchy-4.5.0-3-x86_64.pkg.tar.zst (sha256 bfe75d086c8b5c919280372afdd72e8cc7b0f66745f052d826b5a588fdad33eb, in omarchy-4.5.0-3.capture), by: tar --zstd -xf <pkg> usr/share/omarchy/install usr/share/omarchy/migrations; find usr/share/omarchy/install usr/share/omarchy/migrations -type f -print0 | xargs -0 grep -hoE '/etc/[A-Za-z0-9._@+/-]*' | sed -E 's#/+#/#g; :a; s#(/|\.)$##; ta' | grep -vx '/etc' | LC_ALL=C sort -u. Changed only by a commit, with the pinned version.
